  "one_owner_contract": "One committed Mode00CompleteCommands; fixed existing voices[12]; temporary transactional preview only. applyRaw is a caller-metadata research fixture boundary and must not be driven by a second independently advancing allocator. Plan slot/edge annotations are retained but not interpreted.",
