    "analytic waveform helpers, no target ROM recovered",
    "zero phase/history configure on genuine off-to-on only",
    "48kHz native cadence",
    "TL0.75dB/step and >=99 mute endpoint",
    "96dB envelope retirement and current rate/RKS laws",
    "original mapped-note RKS rather than inferred silicon FNUM/block keycode",
    "FNUM grid/reference-clock frequency hypothesis and multiplier/detune law",
    "two-sample feedback history",
    "existing output/chorus behavior; no new supply/noise law"
